stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ResultCreated
    ResultCreated --> SavedRun : authenticated and autosave enabled
    ResultCreated --> TransientRun : guest or autosave disabled

    TransientRun --> SavedRun : save_display_files
    TransientRun --> SavedRun : sync selected run
    SavedRun --> TransientRun : unsave_display_files
    SavedRun --> TransientRun : sync deselects run

    SavedRun --> Retained : durable database rows and result artifacts
    TransientRun --> SessionAccessible : available during current review session
    SessionAccessible --> SavedRun : user saves before cleanup
    SessionAccessible --> CleanupEligible : retention cutoff, cancel, or explicit delete
    CleanupEligible --> Deleted : remove transient artifacts and rows

    note right of SavedRun
      SegmentedImage.user points to
      the authenticated account.
    end note

    note right of TransientRun
      Transient outputs can be reviewed
      but are eligible for cleanup.
    end note

    Retained --> [*]
    Deleted --> [*]
